# Lab 02 — Azure RBAC Role Assignments

## Objective

Create, inspect and validate an Azure RBAC role assignment using a least-privilege approach.

The lab demonstrates:

```text
Principal
   ↓
Role
   ↓
Scope
   ↓
Role Assignment
   ↓
Validated Access
```

No role assignment should be created until the required task, role and scope have been identified.

---

## Learning Objectives

By the end of this lab, I will be able to:

- Identify an appropriate Azure RBAC role.
- Identify the smallest practical scope.
- Assign an Azure RBAC role.
- Inspect role assignments.
- Validate the resulting assignment.
- Understand direct vs inherited access.
- Remove an assignment when it is no longer required.

---

